%N A398368 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} H(k) * AH(k) / k^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and AH(k) = A058313(k)/A058312(k) is the k-th alternating harmonic (or skew-harmonic) number.
